A lovelorn is small and undead: a knot of wet organs that moves on legs. It hides under whatever is at hand and skitters out to bite.

Two came out of hiding in [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Detective Ellis Brooks|Detective Brooks]]'s apartment. One crawled out from under the couch and took [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] by the leg, holding on after it bit him. Another came up behind [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] and later latched onto his face, and had to be pulled off. They frighten the people they fight, and flee when it suits them. [[People/Anzu|Anzu]] called them heart undead.
